        <div id="dsq-comment-body-29" class="dsq-comment-body">
            <div id="dsq-comment-message-29" class="dsq-comment-message"><p>Hello Ryan,</p>
<p>What&#8217;s the solution when we need to protect the URL like /Products/Edit/1 where &#8220;1&#8221; is a productId?</p>
