        <div id="dsq-comment-body-35" class="dsq-comment-body">
            <div id="dsq-comment-message-35" class="dsq-comment-message"><p>Hi Ryan, this is exatcly what I am looking for, well at least I think that it is. I am using the Preview 2 download and so I had to make some changes to the web.config file to ref those files instead. I also had to change the Html.Form parameters around as these have been altered I guess for Prev2.</p>
